# Alauda language file - Japanese (UTF-8).
#
# Put this file in <foobar2000 profile>\languages, not next to the component
# DLL. Open Folder on the Profiles page opens the folder Alauda actually reads.
#
# Save as UTF-8 or every value is lost. A value cannot end in a space.
# See alauda_en_template.lng for the full translation instructions.

